                                Asset Management                            </a>
                        </li>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=our-team&lang=en">
                                Our Team                            </a>
                        </li>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=about&lang=en">
                                About Us                            </a>
                        </li>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=contact&lang=en">
                                Contact Us                            </a>
                        </li>
                                            </ul>
                </nav>
                
                <!-- Section 3: Language Switcher -->
                <div class="language-switcher"><a href="?page=team-member&id=dan-rosenberg&lang=en" class="lang-switch active" data-lang="en">EN</a><span class="separator">|</span><a href="?page=team-member&id=dan-rosenberg&lang=he" class="lang-switch " data-lang="he">עב</a></div>            </div>
        </div>
    </header>
    <main id="main-content">


<section class="team-member-page">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="navigation-breadcrumb">
            <a href="?page=our-team&lang=en" class="back-link">
                <span class="back-arrow">←</span> 
                Back to Team            </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="member-container">
            <div class="member-profile-card">
                <div class="member-header">
                    <div class="member-title-section">
                        <h1 class="member-name">Dan Rosenberg</h1>
                        
                        <p class="primary-role">Co-Founder and Director - PI Pituach</p>                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="member-content">
                    <div class="member-bio">
                        Co-Founder and Director at Pi Pituach Group, which includes Pi Deposits and Pi Plus, both reporting companies issuing deposit-backed bonds on the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange. Served as a senior trader at the Pi SPC hedge fund since 2010. With over 20 years of experience in trading derivative instruments and complex interest rate transactions, possesses unique expertise in pricing sophisticated financial instruments and managing risks associated with them. Previously held the position of senior interest rate trader in the trading room of Bank Hapoalim.                    </div>
                    
                                        
                                        
                                    </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="member-navigation">
                                <a href="?page=team-member&id=jonny-kaye&lang=en" class="navigation-button prev-button">
                    <span class="nav-icon">←</span>
                    <span class="nav-text">Previous</span>
                </a>
                                
                                <a href="?page=team-member&id=itai-ruschkewitz&lang=en" class="navigation-button next-button">
                    <span class="nav-text">Next</span>
                    <span class="nav-icon">→</span>
                </a>
                            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

</main>
